    aps-environment (APNs wake-ups, task 22), com.apple.security.application-groups = group.ua.pp.chds.async (shared with the
    File Provider extension of task 25), keychain-access-groups = $(AppIdentifierPrefix)ua.pp.chds.async (the same).
-->
